  {
    "id": 2015004010010,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "うーん……ここが、良いかな……\r\nそれとも、こっち……？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花、何してるんだ？\r\n調べものか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010020,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "あ……プロデューサーさん\r\nそ、その……夏祭り、調べてる……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "なーちゃんと、一緒に行きたくって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もうすぐ夏だからなぁ\r\nお祭りがはじまる時期だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010040,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……\r\nいっぱいあるから、迷って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど……\r\n候補はあるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010050,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "えっと、ここ……とか……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0124",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 800
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、良さそうだな\r\n花火もやってるし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010060,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nなーちゃんと、見るの……楽しみ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、思いっきり楽しんで来い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……だけど、大丈夫か？\r\nお祭りって人混みすごいだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010070,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "う、うん……そうだけど、平気……\r\nなーちゃんがいるし、それに……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010080,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "お祭り……人、いっぱいいるけど……\r\nきらきらしてて……甜花、好き",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良かった、それなら安心だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010090,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プ、プロデューサーさんは……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　俺？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010100,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "お祭り……好き？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、なんだかわくわくするよな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、前は行くこともあったけど、\r\nここ数年は忙しくて行けてないんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010110,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……っ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……甜花、どうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010120,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……だ、だって、プロデューサーさん行けないのに……\r\n甜花ばっか、楽しみにしちゃって……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そういうことか……）",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "じゃあ、俺の分まで\r\n楽しんで来てくれ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "また機会はあるさ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "甜花が楽しそうだと\r\n俺も嬉しいよ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010130,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんの分まで？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだ。俺は、甜花が思いっきり楽しんで、\r\nその思い出話をしてくれたら嬉しいよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010140,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "……それで、プロデューサーさんは喜んで、くれる？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010150,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "じゃ、じゃあ、プロデューサーさんに\r\nお話、いっぱいできるように……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010160,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "甜花……なーちゃんと、いっぱい楽しんでくるね……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。土産話、待ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010170,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "機会……\r\nじゃあ、次は……甜花たちと行こう……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、甜花たちと？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010180,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "だ、ダメ……？\r\nな、なーちゃんも、きっと喜ぶ……と、思う……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……甜花、ありがとう\r\nそうだな、きっと楽しそうだ。次の時は、一緒に行こう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010190,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……プロデューサーさん、約束……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010200,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "そうだ……千雪さんも誘って、良い……？\r\nそしたら……もっと、楽しい……から……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201500401/2015004010200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "良いな、それ\r\nあとで千雪にも話をしに行こうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2015004010210,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "にへへ……\r\nみんなでお祭り……行けると良いな……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
